<a style="display:block;width:100%" href="/solutions/industry/home-appliances">Home Appliances</a></li><li class=""><a style="display:block;width:100%" href="/solutions/industry/cosmetics">Beauty &amp; Cosmetics</a></li><li class=""><a style="display:block;width:100%" href="/solutions/industry/groceries">Food &amp; Beverages</a></li><li class=""><a style="display:block;width:100%" href="/solutions/industry/fashion">Fashion &amp; Apparel</a></li><li class=""><a style="display:block;width:100%" href="/solutions/industry/babycare">Baby &amp; Kids</a></li></ul></div></li><li class=""><div class="mobile_menu_title__aIglW"><span>Resources</span><div class="arrow_arrow__uN9DI"></div></div><ul class="mobile_item_children_list__R6pnm"><li class=""><a style="display:block;width:100%" href="/customers">Customer Stories</a></li><li class=""><a style="display:block;width:100%" href="/blog">Blog</a></li></ul></li><li class=""><div class="mobile_menu_title__aIglW"><span>About</span><div class="arrow_arrow__uN9DI"></div></div><ul class="mobile_item_children_list__R6pnm"><li class=""><a style="display:block;width:100%" href="/company/about-us">About Us
</a></li><li class=""><a style="display:block;width:100%" href="/company/contact-us">Contact Us</a></li></ul></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[12px]"><button type="button" class="Button_button__Tpz3i Button_primary__BRlOs wp-button primary"><span>Book a Demo</span></button></div></div></header><main class="mt-[72px]"><div class="mx-auto"><div class="mx-auto"><div class="home-body_container__V_c5b flex flex-col items-center w-full mt-[-72px]"><div class="home-body_banner_wrapper__we5ez"><div class="home-body_banner__UcoPP"><div class="section-container"><h1 class="headline-one"><p>Leverage AI-powered Omnichannel Feedback Analysis to</p><p class="fade-in text-primary">Uncover Customer Pain Points</p></h1><div class="home-body_banner_btns__caSLY"><button class="wp-button primary">Book a Demo</button><button class="wp-button primary ghost">Watch Video</button></div><div class="home-body_workflow___P7yS"><img alt="cem-workflow" loading="lazy" width="1018" height="460" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://yunting-static-1251101074.cos.ap-shanghai.myqcloud.com/cem_site/CEM_00000_iSpt.png"/></div></div></div></div><div class="home-body_introduce__w5NcC section-container"><div class="home-body_introduce_item__B0A4_"><div class="home-body_introduce_content__RyE5H">Customer-Centric Experience</div></div><div class="home-body_introduce_item__B0A4_"><div class="home-body_introduce_content__RyE5H">More Lovable Product</div></div><div class="home-body_introduce_item__B0A4_"><div class="home-body_introduce_content__RyE5H">Increased Market Share</div></div><div class="home-body_introduce_item__B0A4_"><div class="home-body_introduce_content__RyE5H">Accelerated Growth</div></div></div><div class="home-body_features___G8wp section-container"><div class="home-body_feature_item__5_txY"><div class="home-body_feature_image__6ddIq"><img alt="One Unified Platform. All Channels Connected. Real-time Customer Engagements." loading="lazy" width="1400" height="920" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/feature-1.1ab4e4ab.png"/></div><div class="home-body_feature_text__ANFnZ"><h2 class="headline-two">One Unified Platform. All Channels Connected. Real-time Customer Engagements.</h2><p class="home-body_feature_content__Mq7J7">Octoparse CEM: Your central hub for customer interactions across every touchpoint. Integrate e-commerce reviews, social media, chat, surveys, ticketing systems and more into one platform. Respond to every customer cue, transform feedback into actionable insights, and elevate your customer experience.</p></div></div><div class="home-body_feature_item__5_txY"><div class="home-body_feature_image__6ddIq"><img alt="AI-Powered Insights. Make Data Driven Decisions. Drive Sustainable Growth." loading="lazy" width="1400" height="920" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/feature-2.3d5ada89.png"/></div><div class="home-body_feature_text__ANFnZ"><h2 class="headline-two">AI-Powered Insights. Make Data Driven Decisions. Drive Sustainable Growth.</h2><p class="home-body_feature_content__Mq7J7">From complex reviews to nuanced social media posts, our proprietary CX-focused AI analyzes every customer signal at scale. Built on advanced AI models and deep industry knowledge, it transforms unstructured feedback into actionable insights. Uncover hidden preferences, motivations, and usage patterns for an unparalleled 360-degree customer view. Empower teams to make data-driven decisions, refine products, and deliver exceptional experiences that drive growth and loyalty.</p></div></div><div class="home-body_feature_item__5_txY"><div class="home-body_feature_image__6ddIq"><img alt="All Teams Connected. Streamlined Workflow." loading="lazy" width="1400" height="920" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/feature-3.db63a5ff.png"/></div><div class="home-body_feature_text__ANFnZ"><h2 class="headline-two">All Teams Connected. Streamlined Workflow.</h2><p class="home-body_feature_content__Mq7J7">Collobrate across teams and drive customer-centric growth. From Product Development to Customer Support, Sales to Fulfillment, our advanced ticketing and notification systems ensures real-time risk alerts, direct them to the right team, and deliver complete data insights to all relevant teams. Eliminate data silos, turn data into actionable strategies, and enhance product quality, messaging, and customer experience.</p></div></div></div><div class="home-body_brands__ODJFc"><div class="section-container"><h1 class="headline-one text-center">Top brands trust Octoparse CEM</h1><div class="home-body_brands_top__XRL7P"><div class="home-body_brands_top_item__uJyuc"><div class="home-body_top__z23bG">Octoparse CEM brings us closer to our customers than ever before, so we can prioritize needs and craft products that truly resonate with our customers.</div><div class="home-body_bottom__5gT5d"><div class="home-body_left__qV2cl"><div>Raymond F.</div><div class="home-body_job__hyKas">Head of CMI Siemens</div></div><div class="home-body_right__wplH8"><img alt="brand-top-bosch" loading="lazy" width="216" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/brand_top_1.4352f24d.png"/></div></div></div><div class="home-body_brands_top_item__uJyuc"><div class="home-body_top__z23bG">Octoparse CEM has given us real-time access to our customers thoughts, allowing us to continuously improve with every drive.</div><div class="home-body_bottom__5gT5d"><div class="home-body_left__qV2cl"><div>Bo T.</div><div class="home-body_job__hyKas">Senior Operation Director</div></div><div class="home-body_right__wplH8"><img alt="brand-top-ford" loading="lazy" width="128" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/brand_top_2.fabe1f79.png"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center py-